---
---

<section class="border-y border-gray-100 bg-white px-4 py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-red md:text-4xl">Como funciona?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl font-medium text-gray-600">
        O método R4T foi desenhado para ser direto ao ponto. Você não vai perder tempo com teorias
        chatas, vamos direto para a graxa.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Bloco 1: O Método */}
    <div class="mb-16 flex flex-col items-center gap-8 md:flex-row">
      <div class="order-2 w-full md:order-1 md:w-1/2">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-100 text-xl font-bold text-brand-red">
              1
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-1 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Acesso Imediato ao Portal</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                Assim que o pagamento for confirmado, você recebe no seu e-mail o acesso completo a
                todas as videoaulas na nossa plataforma fechada.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-100 text-xl font-bold text-brand-red">
              2
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-1 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Assista de Qualquer Dispositivo</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                Aulas em alta resolução gravadas direto da bancada. Assista pelo celular, tablet ou
                computador quantas vezes precisar.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-100 text-xl font-bold text-brand-red">
              3
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="mb-1 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Aplica e Acelera</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                Mostramos o passo a passo da montagem, as folgas exatas e o acerto final. É só
                copiar e colar na sua oficina ou garagem.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Imagem Mockup (Notebook) */}
      <div class="order-1 w-full md:order-2 md:w-1/2">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-gray-100 p-6 shadow-inner ring-1 ring-gray-200">
          <div class="relative flex aspect-[4/3] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-gray-800 shadow-xl">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iOCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI4IiBmaWxsPSIjMDAwIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8cGF0aCBkPSJNMCAwTDggOFpNOCAwTDAgOFoiIHN0cm9rZT0iI2ZmZiIgc3Ryb2tlLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8L3N2Zz4=')] opacity-20"></div>
            <p class="z-10 font-medium text-gray-400">Mockup Notebook / Celular</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Bloco 2: Pré-requisitos */}
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 md:flex-row">
      {/* Imagem Mockup (Peças) */}
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-gray-100 p-6 shadow-inner ring-1 ring-gray-200">
          <div class="relative flex aspect-[4/3] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-gray-800 shadow-xl">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iOCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI4IiBmaWxsPSIjMDAwIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8cGF0aCBkPSJNMCAwTDggOFpNOCAwTDAgOFoiIHN0cm9rZT0iI2ZmZiIgc3Ryb2tlLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8L3N2Zz4=')] opacity-20"></div>
            <p class="z-10 font-medium text-gray-400">Mockup Monitor / Peças</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-red">Pré-Requisitos:</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 font-medium text-gray-600">
          Você não precisa ser o mestre da mecânica para entender esse conteúdo. Explicamos tudo
          mastigado. Apenas precisa:
        </p>

        <ul class="mb-8 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg
              class="h-5 w-5 text-brand-red"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-800">Ferramentas básicas de oficina</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg
              class="h-5 w-5 text-brand-red"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-800">
              Força de vontade para sujar a mão de graxa
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg
              class="h-5 w-5 text-brand-red"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-800">
              Vontade de deixar os amigos comendo poeira
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <a
          href="#oferta"
          class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-brand-red px-8 py-3 text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand-red/30 transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:bg-brand-red-dark"
        >
          GARANTIR MEU ACESSO
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
